%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/announcement/mv3-g07a/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/drawer/chat-settings/group-announcement-section/group-announcement-section.component.ts::loadAnnouncements；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::queryAnnouncementList
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员打开群设置的公告区，看到该会话下的全部公告；一条都没有时看到空态而不是报错。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=partial；helix=partial；dual=yes；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: queryAnnouncements(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_announcement_list", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_announcement_list", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_announcement_list", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 读回会话的群公告列表 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /post/announcement/list
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（announcementListUpdated，ANNOUNCEMENT_LIST_UPDATED，im:announcement:list-updated）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：首次查询返回 channelId,version,announcements 权威快照；Angular 按 channelId+version 绝对覆盖，不得与旧数组增量拼接；未 seed 过公告的 channelId 返回 []（length === 0），且不抛错、不 emit
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：announcement version 的唯一 owner 是 Go：按 account/team + channelId 持久化单调版本，并只在 save/delete 事务真实改变公告集合时递增；announcementChanged audience 固定为变更后仍有频道可见权的成员；wire 只含 channelId/version，不得携带 legacy acceptList 或完整正文
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：announcementListUpdated，ANNOUNCEMENT_LIST_UPDATED，im:announcement:list-updated；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
